  "conclusion": {
    "primary": "The five tests have an observable fixture-isolation gap: their permission/prefix assertions accidentally depend on silence from host login profiles. The current host profile source plus original output signature strongly supports that trigger.",
    "not_established": "No product permission, owner, sandbox-admission or file-descriptor lifecycle defect is demonstrated by these five failures. Do not broaden filesystem/network authority or suppress stderr.",
